### Configuración de Token para Rutas Protegidas (ADMIN)
@admin_token = rellenar_con_token_jwt_admin

### Prerequisites: Create editorial, autor, genero first (ADMIN)

### Create editorial for libro tests (201, ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8000/editoriales
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

{
  "nombre": "Editorial Test",
  "pais": "Argentina"
}

### Create autor for libro tests (201, ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8000/autores
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

{
  "nombre": "Autor Test",
  "nacionalidad": "Argentina"
}

### Create genero for libro tests (201, ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8000/generos
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

{
  "nombre": "Ficción"
}

### Create libro with authors and stock_inicial - success (201, ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8000/libros
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

{
  "isbn": "978-987-1234-56-7",
  "titulo": "El Libro de Prueba",
  "precio": "29.99",
  "stock_inicial": 10,
  "editorial_id": 1,
  "genero_id": 1,
  "autores": [
    {
      "autor_id": 1,
      "rol": "autor",
      "orden": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Create libro - duplicate ISBN (409, ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8000/libros
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

{
  "isbn": "978-987-1234-56-7",
  "titulo": "Otro Libro",
  "precio": "19.99",
  "stock_inicial": 5,
  "editorial_id": 1,
  "genero_id": 1,
  "autores": []
}

### Create libro - sending stock directly fails with 422 (extra="forbid")
POST http://localhost:8000/libros
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

{
  "isbn": "978-987-9999-99-9",
  "titulo": "Libro Inválido",
  "precio": "19.99",
  "stock": 10,
  "editorial_id": 1
}

### List libros - default pagination (200, Público)
GET http://localhost:8000/libros

### List libros - custom pagination (200, Público)
GET http://localhost:8000/libros?page=1&size=5

### List libros - filter by titulo (200, Público)
GET http://localhost:8000/libros?titulo=Prueba

### Get libro by id - success (200, Público)
GET http://localhost:8000/libros/1

### Get libro by id - not found (404, Público)
GET http://localhost:8000/libros/999

### Update libro - success (200, ADMIN)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/libros/1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

{
  "titulo": "El Libro de Prueba (Edición Especial)",
  "precio": "34.99"
}

### Update libro - sending stock directly fails with 422 (extra="forbid")
PATCH http://localhost:8000/libros/1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

{
  "stock": 50
}

### Reponer stock - success (200, ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8000/libros/1/reponer
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

{
  "cantidad": 5
}

### Reponer stock - invalid cantidad <= 0 (422, ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8000/libros/1/reponer
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

{
  "cantidad": 0
}

### List movimientos de stock (200, ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8000/libros/1/movimientos
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

### Soft delete libro (204, ADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/libros/1
Cookie: access_token={{admin_token}}

### Verify libro is 404 after soft delete (404, Público)
GET http://localhost:8000/libros/1
